&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQ_xX435eGjGhU-HJ4fyPRtDB03ckqwzkt6CS7NC2I-nQ&oe=6B0312F4"}, {"file_name": "Trailer 2.png", "id": "1339585267486548", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491821099_1339585270819881_5752003200383625231_n.png?_nc_cat=101&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ZqTvUwWVfK8Q7kNvwHlxbM9&_nc_oc=Adr_XoT9z6noEyXznZn08uM2rRZ6f4ejJv_R53TvZnSdBRVMdCPGk6HWI860joUHjXA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQJIT5YoufXJArWUKOic6X3Nfh5N2BmrJWgna6PqmBKkg&oe=6B03078D"}, {"file_name": "Trailer 4.png", "id": "25299459349722807", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491822307_25299459369722805_1875565800982623569_n.png?_nc_cat=103&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=riuKFmeGFY4Q7kNvwFj_lsH&_nc_oc=AdrJujge1dH2h6nWlajndnq0Awmy3wVqgg_cdA8VtADd2virhiTo8HA67jCGgVf4BLM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRiNd8wjVmrlpO76YUQ_dbERrTXXcVYsI2Mfbpjpr2aFg&oe=6B03140F"}, {"file_name": "Trailer 5.png", "id": "2038404890292862", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491819859_2038404893626195_50283950361106217_n.png?_nc_cat=109&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=6C65aMSgoE4Q7kNvwESOBnB&_nc_oc=AdpiokWJgjKUWbgpHApx6ST_hSYgp2rs8QKmb5jzIjvbpTbVXnf5RYH2-BLSzTTdHKU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRASAVAJhK6JMxKtbxGkIr3hkKgh3SOQZDw8WV-tMe73Q&oe=6B030BF7"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "trailer poster.png", "id": "1340193764070608", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491819239_1340193767403941_2787865297931591383_n.png?_nc_cat=103&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=7xB6wj3Ka4kQ7kNvwE3gTyZ&_nc_oc=AdoSGDRwn9RZumh8lM4Xsd_KBKxNMs3hDLX64kAM-E6N74B36uTuVjkKTZspCNv9Lqo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRhLpEIQPf2GRcJYRt1KVJf7NTLZKQzrcDotZPDTtxGGQ&oe=6B0322D8"}, "display_name": "Plank n' Kitty", "keywords": [], "long_description": "## Plank n' Kitty\n\nGran\u2019s cat has wandered off and ended up at the end of a plank high above the city!\n\nStep through the doorway into a virtual cartoon world, walk the plank, rescue the kitty, and bring it safely back to gran.\n\n**Plank \u2019n Kitty is a mixed-reality experience, not a game.**  \nIt\u2019s designed to be fun, approachable, and best enjoyed with friends or family taking turns.  \nEveryone can join in by watching the action on TV or mobile.\n\n---\n\n## What makes it different\n\n- **Two-way mixed-reality portal**  \n  A door in your room opens into a virtual world \u2014 and from the plank, the door becomes a portal back into your real room.\n\n- **Exciting but not extreme**  \n  High enough to feel thrilling, without pushing into fear-only territory. Accessible fun for everybody.\n\n- **Configurable play space**  \n  Preview and adjust the size and position to fit your room before you start.\n\n- **Perfect for group play**  \n  Take turns, watch reactions, and enjoy it together.\n\n- **TV casting support**  \n  Cast to a TV so everyone can see what the player sees.\n\n---\n\n## Device Support\nSupports mixed reality on Quest 2, Quest 3, and Quest Pro.  \nPassthrough quality varies by device.\n\n---\n\n## Comfort Note\nThis experience involves real-world movement.  \nThis is a **room-scale mixed reality experience** and adapts to your available space.  \nMake sure your area is clear before playing.", "short_description": "Gran\u2019s cat has gone missing. Step through the portal, walk the plank high above the city, and bring the kitty home. A fun, approachable mixed-reality experience made for friends, families, and party play."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.rayamedia.com/home/plank-n-kitty-privacy-policy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Rayamedia", "s